source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Inside an open list a run of only dashes is a marker at the depth its length names, so Jira nests the item under the one above it.
-- input.jira --
* a
-- b
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>a
	<ul class="alternate" type="square">
		<li>b</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- a
    - b
-- warnings.json --
[]
